                    "title": "",
                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \ud83d\ude80 Anthropic Fleet Overview  `[v3.3-final \u2022 Complete Edition]`\nCompare Model Token Share vs Request Share side-by-side, inspect multi-model adoption trends, and audit the Fleet Leaderboard Table.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** 00 Usage Summary | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | **[02 Fleet Overview]** | 03 Latency & SLOs | 04 Errors & Reliability | 05 Caching & FinOps | 06 Capacity & Quota  \n*Features: Multi-Dimensional Interactive Filters \u2022 Ratio Scorecards \u2022 Donut Shares \u2022 Dual-Axis Correlation \u2022 Live Data Tables \u2022 SRE/FinOps Playbooks*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#0D1B2A",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
